# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  requests.http  –  click "Send Request" above any ### block (REST Client extension).
#  Start with "1. Login"; every later request reuses the token. Server must be running.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Login as the ASHA health worker (Kalahandi). Try 9000000040 (doctor), 9000000030 (patient), 9000000020 (pharmacist)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone_or_email": "9000000010", "password": "1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 2. Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. How does the AI read symptoms typed in Hinglish? (no login needed)
GET {{base}}/triage/understand?text=bukhar aur khansi 3 din se

### 4. …and in Odia script
GET {{base}}/triage/understand?text=ଛାତି ବିନ୍ଧା, ଶ୍ୱାସ କଷ୍ଟ

### 5. AI symptom checker – fever + cough 4 days, auto-book best doctor, phone is on 120 kbps
POST {{base}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symptoms": "bukhar aur khansi", "duration_days": 4, "patient_id": 2, "auto_book": true, "network_kbps": 120 }

### 6. AI symptom checker – chest pain in Odia → EMERGENCY (escalated, NOT booked)
POST {{base}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symptoms": "ଛାତି ବିନ୍ଧା, ଶ୍ୱାସ କଷ୍ଟ", "patient_id": 3, "auto_book": true }

### 7. Which doctors can take an Odia-speaking child right now? (AI ranked)
GET {{base}}/doctors/available?specialty=pediatrics&language=or&region_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Video, audio or text? The app measures its network and asks
GET {{base}}/network/recommend-mode?kbps=120&latency_ms=400

### 9. Which nearby pharmacies have Paracetamol right now?
GET {{base}}/pharmacy/availability/1?region_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Search medicines in Hindi
GET {{base}}/pharmacy/medicines?q=पैरासिटामोल

### 11. Patient's whole file in one response (cache it offline)
GET {{base}}/patients/1/bundle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. OFFLINE SYNC – push 2 patients + a triage done with no signal
POST {{base}}/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "asha-phone-1",
  "records": [
    { "type": "patient", "client_id": "uuid-100", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T09:00:00",
      "data": { "name": "Sunita Majhi", "age": 29, "sex": "F", "phone": "9000000101", "village": "Thuamul Rampur", "region_id": 1, "language": "or", "is_pregnant": true } },
    { "type": "triage", "client_id": "uuid-101", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T09:05:00",
      "data": { "patient_client_id": "uuid-100", "symptoms": "ଜ୍ୱର", "duration_days": 2 } }
  ]
}

### 13. OFFLINE SYNC – pull only what changed since last sync
POST {{base}}/sync/pull
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "device_id": "asha-phone-1", "region_id": 1, "since": "2026-09-27T00:00:00" }

### 14. SMS/IVR messages the villager's phone would receive
GET {{base}}/notifications?phone=9800000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Measurable impact – trips avoided, ₹ saved, per district
GET {{base}}/analytics/impact
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. ⭐ THE DEMO – whole patient journey in one call
POST {{base}}/demo/patient-journey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. ⭐ Emergency path
POST {{base}}/demo/emergency
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. ⭐ Offline sync demo
POST {{base}}/demo/offline-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Everything the system did automatically (show to judges)
GET {{base}}/events?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. AI Service Health & Diagnostics
# Checks active LLM provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, or clinical fallback), active model, and engine readiness.
# Expected Output: {"status":"ok","configured_provider":"fallback","model":"clinical_rules_engine_v1","fallback_engine_ready":true}
GET {{base}}/ai/status

### 21. AI Symptom Triage – Hinglish symptoms with vitals
# Health worker or patient inputs symptoms in Hindi/Hinglish with vitals. AI evaluates urgency, differential, reasoning, and home care.
# Expected Output: {"urgency":"urgent","escalation_required":false,"recommended_specialty":"general_medicine","model_name":"clinical_rules_engine_v1","fallback_used":true}
POST {{base}}/ai/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "bukhar aur tez khansi 3 din se",
  "age": 32,
  "sex": "M",
  "duration_days": 3,
  "spo2": 97,
  "temperature_c": 38.4,
  "bp_systolic": 120,
  "bp_diastolic": 80,
  "pulse": 84,
  "language": "hi"
}

### 22. AI Symptom Triage – Emergency chest pain with hard guardrails
# Emergency red flags (chest pain, breathlessness) trigger immediate escalation to hospital / 108 ambulance.
# Expected Output: {"urgency":"emergency","escalation_required":true,"recommended_specialty":"emergency","model_name":"clinical_rules_engine_v1","fallback_used":true}
POST {{base}}/ai/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "seene me tez dard aur sans lene me dikkat",
  "age": 58,
  "sex": "M",
  "duration_days": 1,
  "spo2": 88,
  "language": "hi"
}

### 23. AI Patient Summary – Fetch and synthesize from database (Patient #1)
# Synthesizes records, vitals history, and active prescriptions into a unified EHR clinical summary.
# Expected Output: {"patient_id":1,"patient_name":"Laxmi Nayak","risk_level":"low","model_name":"deterministic_clinical_summary","fallback_used":true}
POST {{base}}/ai/patient-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "focus": "clinical_overview",
  "language": "en"
}

### 24. AI Patient Summary – Custom external clinical payload
# Generates summary for patient records without querying database.
# Expected Output: {"patient_name":"Suresh Chandra","risk_level":"high","model_name":"deterministic_clinical_summary","fallback_used":true}
POST {{base}}/ai/patient-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_name": "Suresh Chandra",
  "age": 62,
  "sex": "M",
  "chronic_conditions": "Type 2 Diabetes, Hypertension",
  "allergies": "Sulfa drugs",
  "recent_vitals": {
    "bp_systolic": 152,
    "bp_diastolic": 94,
    "spo2": 96,
    "temperature_c": 37.0
  },
  "recent_prescriptions": [
    "Metformin 500 mg 1-0-1",
    "Amlodipine 5 mg 1-0-0"
  ],
  "focus": "handover",
  "language": "en"
}

### 25. AI Doctor Note Drafting – Generate SOAP Note & E-Prescriptions
# Used by doctors or health workers to draft standard SOAP documentation and formulary prescriptions.
# Expected Output: {"chief_complaint":"Acute productive cough...","e_prescription_ready":true,"model_name":"deterministic_soap_engine","fallback_used":true}
POST {{base}}/ai/doctor-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chief_complaint": "Acute productive cough and intermittent high fever for 4 days",
  "duration": "4 days",
  "symptoms_and_history": "Patient notes yellow sputum, mild breathlessness on exertion, chills in evening. No chest pain.",
  "vitals": {
    "bp": "124/82",
    "pulse": 88,
    "spo2": 96,
    "temp_c": 38.6
  },
  "physical_examination": "Throat congested with mild pharyngeal injection. Bilateral vesicular breath sounds with scattered rhonchi.",
  "raw_dictation_or_notes": "Likely viral tracheobronchitis with mild secondary bronchospasm. Advised steam, paracetamol, hydration.",
  "clinical_impression": "Acute Tracheobronchitis with Pyrexia",
  "language": "en"
}
